# Not needed for the normal setup — the frontend calls `/api/...` on the
# same origin by default (see src/api/base44Client.js), since the API now
# lives in this same Vercel project (api/[...path].ts) alongside the
# frontend. Only set this if the API is hosted on a different origin, e.g.
# the optional standalone server/main.ts running elsewhere.
# VITE_API_URL=
